{"seq":2,"slug":"xrf-xps","title":"X 射线荧光与光电子能谱（XRF & XPS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/xrf-xps","wordCount":2900,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"x-射线荧光与光电子能谱-xrf-xps\">X 射线荧光与光电子能谱（XRF &amp; XPS）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>XRF 与 XPS 共享同一个物理起点——<strong>X 射线照射物质引发的光电效应</strong>——却在这个起点之后分成两条路：一条测量&quot;空穴被填补时发出的次级 X 射线&quot;（XRF），另一条测量&quot;被弹出的光电子&quot;（XPS）。因此一个回答&quot;有什么元素、多少&quot;，另一个进一步回答&quot;元素以什么化学态存在、分布在多浅的表面&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    X[&quot;X 射线照射样品&quot;] --&gt; PE[&quot;光电效应 内层电子被弹出&quot;]&#10;    PE --&gt; H[&quot;内层空穴&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; FL[&quot;外层电子填补 发出特征荧光 X 射线&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; AU[&quot;Auger 电子 或 光电子&quot;]&#10;    FL --&gt; XRF[&quot;XRF 元素定性与定量&quot;]&#10;    PE --&gt; XPS[&quot;XPS 测量光电子动能&quot;]&#10;    XRF --&gt; WDX[&quot;WDXRF 高分辨 工业主量&quot;]&#10;    XRF --&gt; EDX[&quot;EDXRF 快速 便携 多元素&quot;]&#10;    XPS --&gt; CS[&quot;化学位移 0.1-10 eV 定化学态&quot;]&#10;    XPS --&gt; SURF[&quot;检测深度 1-10 nm 表面分析&quot;]\">graph TD\n    X[\"X 射线照射样品\"] --&gt; PE[\"光电效应 内层电子被弹出\"]\n    PE --&gt; H[\"内层空穴\"]\n    H --&gt; FL[\"外层电子填补 发出特征荧光 X 射线\"]\n    H --&gt; AU[\"Auger 电子 或 光电子\"]\n    FL --&gt; XRF[\"XRF 元素定性与定量\"]\n    PE --&gt; XPS[\"XPS 测量光电子动能\"]\n    XRF --&gt; WDX[\"WDXRF 高分辨 工业主量\"]\n    XRF --&gt; EDX[\"EDXRF 快速 便携 多元素\"]\n    XPS --&gt; CS[\"化学位移 0.1-10 eV 定化学态\"]\n    XPS --&gt; SURF[\"检测深度 1-10 nm 表面分析\"]</pre><p>核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一个物理起点，两种信号</strong>：光电效应产生内层空穴；空穴被外层电子填补时释放的能量，要么以特征 X 射线（荧光）发射（XRF 测量的对象），要么传给另一个电子把其弹出（Auger 电子）。XPS 直接测量初级光电子，XRF 测量次级荧光。</li>\n<li><strong>元素&quot;指纹&quot;来自能级差</strong>：Moseley 定律表明特征 X 射线波长（能量）由原子序数唯一决定，因此谱峰位置即元素身份；XPS 中峰位以结合能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表征，同样元素特异。</li>\n<li><strong>XPS 的独特能力是化学位移</strong>：同一元素在不同化学环境中结合能位移 0.1-10 eV，可区分同一元素的氧化态与成键方式（如 Fe⁰/Fe²⁺/Fe³⁺、C 1s 的多种含氧基团）——这是纯元素分析技术（XRF）做不到的。</li>\n<li><strong>表面灵敏性是 XPS 的另一种&quot;标签&quot;</strong>：光电子非弹性平均自由程只有 1-10 nm，因此 XPS 天然只探测最外层几个纳米，是研究表面氧化、腐蚀、催化活性位的利器；XRF 则是体相分析（μm-mm 深）。</li>\n<li><strong>常见误解</strong>：认为 XRF 不能测轻元素（如 Li、Be）就&quot;不如 XPS&quot;。实则两者定位不同——XRF 无损、快速、可大气环境、适合体相主次成分与现场筛查；XPS 需超高真空、只测表面，但提供化学态。不存在谁更强，只有谁更合适。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡</strong>：WDXRF 分辨力与精度最高但仪器大、慢；EDXRF 快、便携但分辨力有限、轻元素受限。XPS 信息丰富但真空要求高、定量精度仅 ±10%，且对样品表面平整度敏感。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"x-射线与物质相互作用的基础\">X 射线与物质相互作用的基础</h2><p>X 射线是波长 0.01-10 nm 的高能电磁辐射。当 X 射线照射物质时，会发生多种相互作用过程：光电效应（内层电子被完全弹出）、康普顿散射（非弹性散射，X 射线光子与外层电子交换能量）、瑞利散射（弹性散射）和电子对产生（超高能量时）。在分析化学中最重要的是光电效应——它是 XRF 和 XPS 两种技术的共同物理基础。</p>\n<p>光电效应中，入射 X 射线光子将原子内层电子完全弹出，产生光电子和内层空穴。随后外层电子跃迁填补空穴，多余能量以特征 X 射线（荧光）或 Auger 电子的形式释放。检测这些特征辐射或电子即可确定元素组成和化学状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"x-射线荧光光谱-xrf\">X 射线荧光光谱（XRF）</h2><h3 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h3><p>X 射线荧光光谱（X-Ray Fluorescence Spectrometry, XRF）利用初级 X 射线（来自 X 射线管或放射性同位素源）激发样品产生次级特征 X 射线（荧光），通过测量荧光 X 射线的波长（能量）和强度实现元素定性定量。</p>\n<p>Moseley 定律描述了特征 X 射线波长与原子序数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\lambda} = K(Z - \\sigma)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>或等价地，特征 X 射线能量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = h\\nu = R_\\infty hc(Z - \\sigma)^2 \\left(\\frac{1}{n_1^2} - \\frac{1}{n_2^2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4023em;vertical-align:-0.9523em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9523em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9523em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 为屏蔽常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1, n_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为主量子数。每种元素的 K、L、M 系列特征线的能量是唯一的，构成该元素的&quot;X 射线指纹&quot;。XRF 可检测从 Na（Z=11）到 U（Z=92）的所有元素（能量色散 EDXRF）；波长色散 WDXRF 在轻元素方面可延伸到 Be（Z=4）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"波长色散-xrf-wdxrf\">波长色散 XRF（WDXRF）</h3><p>WDXRF 使用分光晶体（如 LiF、PET、TAP）对荧光 X 射线进行 Bragg 衍射分光：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\lambda = 2d\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nλ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同波长的荧光 X 射线在不同角度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 Bragg 条件，通过旋转分光晶体和检测器（角度扫描或多通道固定），逐一或同时检测各元素的特征线。</p>\n<p>WDXRF 的优势：能量分辨率极高（可分辨相邻元素的谱线重叠）、定量精度高（RSD &lt;0.1%）、适合高浓度基质中主次组分分析。广泛应用于水泥、矿石、钢铁、玻璃等工业分析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"能量色散-xrf-edxrf\">能量色散 XRF（EDXRF）</h3><p>EDXRF 使用半导体检测器（Si(Li) 或 Silicon Drift Detector SDD）直接测量荧光 X 射线光子的能量。所有元素的荧光信号同时被检测，无需分光晶体和角度扫描，因此仪器结构简单紧凑、分析速度快。</p>\n<p>现代 SDD 探测器的能量分辨率约 125-140 eV（@Mn Kα 5.9 keV），足以分辨大多数相邻元素。EDXRF 特别适合于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>便携式现场分析（手持式 XRF，重量 &lt;2 kg）</li>\n<li>多元素快速筛查</li>\n<li>涂层厚度测量</li>\n<li>贵金属成色鉴定</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"全反射-xrf-txrf\">全反射 XRF（TXRF）</h3><p>全反射 XRF 将初级 X 射线以极小掠射角（&lt;0.1°）照射在抛光平面样品载体上，利用全反射条件使初级射线在样品表面附近充分激发而不穿透载体，同时大幅降低背景散射。TXRF 可将检测限降低到 pg 级（~10⁹ atoms/cm²），适合超微量分析（如硅晶圆表面金属污染物检测）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"微区-xrf-xrf\">微区 XRF（μ-XRF）</h3><p>使用多毛细管透镜或同步辐射聚焦光束将 X 射线束缩小到 μm 级（同步辐射纳米探针可达 50 nm），逐点扫描样品表面获得元素分布图。同步辐射 μ-XRF 在地球化学（矿物中微量元素分带）、考古学（颜料层分析）和生物学（单细胞内金属分布）中有重要应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"x-射线光电子能谱-xps\">X 射线光电子能谱（XPS）</h2><h3 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h3><p>X 射线光电子能谱（X-ray Photoelectron Spectroscopy, XPS），又称化学分析电子能谱（ESCA, Electron Spectroscopy for Chemical Analysis），由 Kai Siegbahn 开发（1981 年 Nobel 物理学奖）。XPS 使用单色化 X 射线（Al Kα 1486.6 eV 或 Mg Kα 1253.6 eV）照射样品表面，测量被弹出的光电子的动能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k = h\\nu - E_B - \\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 为入射 X 射线光子能量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为电子的结合能（Binding Energy），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 为谱仪功函数。结合能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是元素和化学环境的特征量——不同元素具有不同的核心能级结合能（元素定性），同一元素在不同化学环境中结合能会发生化学位移（化学态鉴定）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"化学位移\">化学位移</h3><p>XPS 最强大的能力是提供化学态信息。当原子周围的化学环境改变时（如氧化态变化、与不同配体成键），核心电子的结合能会发生 0.1-10 eV 的位移。例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>C 1s：烃 C-C/C-H ~284.8 eV；C-O ~286.5 eV；C=O ~288.0 eV；O-C=O ~289.0 eV；CF₂ ~291.5 eV</li>\n<li>Fe 2p₃/₂：Fe⁰ ~707.0 eV；Fe²⁺(FeO) ~709.5 eV；Fe³⁺(Fe₂O₃) ~711.0 eV</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过高分辨谱的峰拟合（Peak Fitting），可以确定同一元素不同化学态的相对含量——这是 XPS 区别于 XRF 等纯元素分析技术的核心优势。</p>\n<h3 id=\"表面灵敏性\">表面灵敏性</h3><p>由于光电子在固体中的非弹性平均自由程（IMFP）很短（1-10 nm 数量级），XPS 检测深度仅为最外层 1-10 nm（约 3λ），是一种表面分析技术。这一特性使 XPS 成为研究表面氧化、腐蚀、涂层、催化剂表面化学的理想工具。</p>\n<p>角分辨 XPS（ARXPS）通过改变检测器相对于样品表面的角度，可进行非破坏性的表面层深度分析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"xps-定量分析\">XPS 定量分析</h3><p>XPS 的定量基于各元素特征峰面积与其表面浓度的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{n_A}{n_B} = \\frac{I_A / S_A}{I_B / S_B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 为峰面积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为相对灵敏度因子（RSF，已知的仪器/元素相关参数）。XPS 定量的典型精度为 ±10%（相对），绝对检测限约 0.1-1 at%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"仪器构成\">仪器构成</h3><p>现代 XPS 系统包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>X 射线源</strong>：单色化 Al Kα 微聚焦源（光斑 10-400 μm）</li>\n<li><strong>能量分析器</strong>：半球形静电分析器（HSA），通过调节通过能量选择不同动能的电子</li>\n<li><strong>检测器</strong>：多通道板（MCP）或 2D 延迟线探测器</li>\n<li><strong>超高真空系统</strong>：基础真空 &lt;10⁻⁹ mbar，防止表面污染</li>\n<li><strong>样品处理</strong>：离子枪（Ar⁺ 溅射清洁表面或深度剖面）、加热/冷却台</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"xrf-与-xps-的比较\">XRF 与 XPS 的比较</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>XRF</th>\n<th>XPS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>激发方式</td>\n<td>X 射线激发荧光</td>\n<td>X 射线弹出光电子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测信号</td>\n<td>荧光 X 射线</td>\n<td>光电子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析深度</td>\n<td>μm-mm（体相分析）</td>\n<td>1-10 nm（表面分析）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学态信息</td>\n<td>无（仅元素组成）</td>\n<td>有（化学位移）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真空要求</td>\n<td>可大气/He</td>\n<td>超高真空（&lt;10⁻⁹ mbar）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间分辨率</td>\n<td>mm-μm</td>\n<td>10-400 μm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测范围</td>\n<td>Na-U（EDXRF）</td>\n<td>Li-U</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定量精度</td>\n<td>高（&lt;1% RSD）</td>\n<td>中（±10%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样品制备</td>\n<td>简单（粉末压片/熔融制样）</td>\n<td>需平整固体表面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"工业质量控制\">工业质量控制</h3><p>WDXRF 是水泥、钢铁、玻璃、陶瓷行业的标准成分分析工具。一台仪器可在 1-3 分钟内同时测定 20+ 种元素，RSD &lt;0.5%，满足过程控制和出厂检验需求。手持式 EDXRF 广泛用于废旧金属回收中的合金快速分选、土壤重金属现场筛查、文物无损成分鉴定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"半导体与电子材料\">半导体与电子材料</h3><p>XPS 是半导体工艺开发和质量控制的核心表征技术：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>栅极氧化物（SiO₂/HfO₂）的化学组成和界面态分析</li>\n<li>金属互连层的氧化/腐蚀监测</li>\n<li>ALD/CVD 薄膜的化学计量比验证</li>\n<li>光刻胶残留物检测</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"催化剂研究\">催化剂研究</h3><p>XPS 用于揭示催化剂表面活性位的化学状态——例如负载型贵金属催化剂中 Pt 的氧化态（Pt⁰ vs PtO vs PtO₂），氮掺杂碳材料中氮的键合方式（吡啶氮、吡咯氮、石墨氮）。这些信息对理解催化机理和优化催化剂设计至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"环境与地质\">环境与地质</h3><p>手持式 XRF 实现了土壤重金属污染的现场快速评估（&quot;指向性采样&quot;），筛查结果指导后续的精确实验室分析。μ-XRF 和 μ-XANES（X 射线吸收近边结构）的联合使用可揭示土壤颗粒中重金属的空间分布和化学形态，对风险评估至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"法医与考古\">法医与考古</h3><p>XRF 在法医中用于枪击残留物（GSR）检测——特征元素组合（Pb-Sb-Ba 或 Gd-Ti-Zn）可指示是否接触过枪支射击。在考古学中，XRF 用于青铜器产地溯源（微量元素指纹）和壁画颜料鉴定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>XRF 和 XPS 是 X 射线分析技术的两大代表。XRF 以其无损、快速、多元素的特点成为工业和环境分析的&quot;万能工具&quot;；XPS 凭借独特的化学态分辨能力和表面灵敏性，是材料科学、催化研究和半导体工艺中不可替代的表征手段。两种技术互补——XRF 告诉我们&quot;有什么元素、含多少&quot;，XPS 进一步告诉我们&quot;元素以什么形式存在、在表面如何分布&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"X 射线荧光与光电子能谱（XRF & XPS）","id":"x-射线荧光与光电子能谱-xrf-xps"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"X 射线与物质相互作用的基础","id":"x-射线与物质相互作用的基础"},{"level":2,"text":"X 射线荧光光谱（XRF）","id":"x-射线荧光光谱-xrf"},{"level":3,"text":"基本原理","id":"基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"波长色散 XRF（WDXRF）","id":"波长色散-xrf-wdxrf"},{"level":3,"text":"能量色散 XRF（EDXRF）","id":"能量色散-xrf-edxrf"},{"level":3,"text":"全反射 XRF（TXRF）","id":"全反射-xrf-txrf"},{"level":3,"text":"微区 XRF（μ-XRF）","id":"微区-xrf-xrf"},{"level":2,"text":"X 射线光电子能谱（XPS）","id":"x-射线光电子能谱-xps"},{"level":3,"text":"基本原理","id":"基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"化学位移","id":"化学位移"},{"level":3,"text":"表面灵敏性","id":"表面灵敏性"},{"level":3,"text":"XPS 定量分析","id":"xps-定量分析"},{"level":3,"text":"仪器构成","id":"仪器构成"},{"level":2,"text":"XRF 与 XPS 的比较","id":"xrf-与-xps-的比较"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"工业质量控制","id":"工业质量控制"},{"level":3,"text":"半导体与电子材料","id":"半导体与电子材料"},{"level":3,"text":"催化剂研究","id":"催化剂研究"},{"level":3,"text":"环境与地质","id":"环境与地质"},{"level":3,"text":"法医与考古","id":"法医与考古"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"原子吸收与发射光谱（Atomic Absorption & Emission Spectroscopy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/atomic-absorption-emission"},"next":{"title":"ICP-MS 与 ICP-OES（电感耦合等离子体质谱与光发射光谱）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/icp-ms-oes"}}